   "title": "SeedVR2 3B and 7B, 2x",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## SeedVR2 3B and 7B, 2x\n\n**You pick:** your render. Needs numz's ComfyUI-SeedVR2_VideoUpscaler pack.\n\nbatch_size 25, temporal_overlap 3, blocks_to_swap 32, noise 0. **For 7B, pick in the model loader:** `seedvr2_ema_7b_fp16.safetensors`. `sageattn_2` needs SageAttention installed; `sdpa` works without it.\n\n**Not checked one last time.** I deleted this model after my tests, so this workflow should run, but I did not run it again before sharing it.\n\nEvery model link and folder: `LINKS.md`."
   ],
